  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(x - (1)/(x)) = (7)/(3)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n (a - b)³ = a³ - b³ - 3ab(a -b) where a and b are 1st and 2nd term respectively.\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n**( x-(1)/(x))³= x³ -(1)/(x³) - 3x(1)/(x)(x- (1)/(x))** \n\n⇒ ((7)/(3))³ = ( {{x³} - (1)/({{x³)}}} ) - 3 × (7)/(3) \n\n⇒ x ³ - (1)/(x)³ = 532/27 = 19 (19)/(27) .\n\n**⇒ Hence, the value is 19(19)/(27)**.",
